    "body": "Thank you for this detailed proposal, and for reading the overlap with #1970 before any code.\n\nTriage: `enhancement`, `P6` (accepted, not scheduled), `effort:high`, `area:ui`, `area:post`, `area:multiaxis`. The effort is high because the values this editor writes feed the clearance gates and the post kinematics (our safety floor), even though most of the work is UI.\n\nYour three questions (order with #1970; the #785 pair beside the #1962 pair; a machine with a tilting head and a rotary table) are design decisions for the maintainer, so I leave them to him here.\n\nIf you want to take it: add a comment with a line that starts with `claimed:` when you start. That comment is the claim, and we mirror it with the label. Please keep the editor's layout your own design; the screenshot as a hint is fine.\n",
